-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-l6p6nk7x" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-l6p6nk7x" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-l6p6nk7xinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-l6p6nk7xinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-kydhfgs2" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydhfgs2 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The popularity of the iconic &#39;Weeping&#39; ghost has motivated collectors over the years to distinguish different mask types. This is particularly challenging among the early &quot;Fun World Div&quot; stamped masks because they come from the same sculpt, making their differences intricate and subtle. We hope this guide can help collectors identify their masks to make informed purchases. </span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-li4q4bwd" class="gpDCD5 comp-li4q4bwd"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-li4q4bwdinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-li4q4bwdinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-li4q4v7m" class="W4V2qg comp-li4q4v7m wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img fetchpriority="high" sizes="443px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d2ee5c6ddb7e457ea187fbeba91d2a4b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_443,h_541,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/MARKINGS5.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d2ee5c6ddb7e457ea187fbeba91d2a4b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_886,h_1082,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/MARKINGS5.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-li4q4v7m" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d2ee5c6ddb7e457ea187fbeba91d2a4b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_443,h_541,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/MARKINGS5.jpg" alt="MARKINGS5.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="443" height="541"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydi05l2" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydi05l2 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Some sculptural markings found on all four early mask types demonstrating their familial relationship.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph7xo6w" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lph7xo6w wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Early <span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Fun World Div </span>stamped masks (</span></span></span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Gen 1, Splotch, HN, Gen 2</span></span></span></span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,avenir-lt-w05_35-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">) derive from the same mother sculpt, confirmed by matching surface details seen across all four types. While all four are classic vintage masks, collectors prioritize them on history, relevance to Scream, shape, era, and quality. Each is considered highly collectible, though value does vary. Our guide will illustrate some ways to identify your mask by exclusively looking at the&nbsp;<span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">#9206 - Glow-in-Dark Mask with Shroud.</span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-li4qckos" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-li4qckos wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-li4qckos" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-li4qckos" class="QG9w8P"><div id="bgMedia_comp-li4qckos" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-li4qckos" class="ROWgFb"><wix-video id="videoContainer_comp-li4qckos" data-video-info="{&quot;fittingType&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;hasBgScrollEffect&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;bgEffectName&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;c5c9bd_840243ffb1f3467394fbbf721c4ee4c2&quot;,&quot;videoWidth&quot;:974,&quot;videoHeight&quot;:750,&quot;qualities&quot;:[{&quot;quality&quot;:&quot;480p&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:177600,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;video/c5c9bd_840243ffb1f3467394fbbf721c4ee4c2/480p/mp4/file.mp4&quot;},{&quot;quality&quot;:&quot;720p&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:730500,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;video/c5c9bd_840243ffb1f3467394fbbf721c4ee4c2/720p/mp4/file.mp4&quot;}],&quot;isVideoDataExists&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;videoFormat&quot;:&quot;mp4&quot;,&quot;playbackRate&quot;:1,&quot;autoPlay&quot;:true,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-li4qckos&quot;,&quot;animatePoster&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-li4qckos" class="aDzdcC bgVideo xSZeaB"><video id="comp-li4qckos_video" class="X9nqm0" crossorigin="anonymous" playsinline="" preload="au