content"><!--$--><div id="comp-kydhnjfq" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydhnjfq wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:37px; text-align:center;"><span style="color:#CA3A00;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:caudex,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:37px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">GEN 1</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfy7esh" class="gpDCD5 comp-lpfy7esh"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfy7eshinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfy7eshinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfy7ext" class="W4V2qg comp-lpfy7ext wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="389px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_feb7b829764e4868aef71c7bb5c44ec4~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_389,h_514,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gen%201.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_feb7b829764e4868aef71c7bb5c44ec4~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_778,h_1028,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gen%201.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpfy7ext" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_feb7b829764e4868aef71c7bb5c44ec4~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_389,h_514,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gen%201.jpg" alt="Gen 1.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="389" height="514"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfyoboc" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfyoboc wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&quot;Gen 1&quot; masks are considered the grail of Scream &amp; Fun World collecting for their use in Scream (1996) and superior quality. Their rarity, competition, and franchise significance give them <span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.itsfuntyme.com/post/suggested-price-guide-scream-masks" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">high value</a></span>. They were the primary masks manufactured during the debut of the &#39;Weeping&#39; ghost in 1992.</span></span></span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;</span>There are markings we use to identify Gen 1s that are easy to recognize using unique mouth markings (<span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Multi-Dot, Second Dimple, Small Dot</span>) found on their production molds. A Gen 1 mask will always have one of these defects, not multiple or all.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfyobp5" class="gpDCD5 comp-lpfyobp5"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfyobp5inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfyobp5inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfyobs7" class="comp-lpfyobs7 wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfyobs7inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfyobs7inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfyobsa" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfyobsa wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">MULTI-DOT</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfyobsc" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfyobsc wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">SECOND DIMPLE</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfyobse" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfyobse wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">SMALL DOT</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfyobsg1" class="W4V2qg comp-lpfyobsg1 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="636px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_ae8e146c2b7c487bae42c77a88db9995~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_59,w_1350,h_1093/fill/w_636,h_515,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271526735_483931813098208_4673103529748094764_n.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_ae8e146c2b7c487bae42c77a88db9995~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_59,w_1350,h_1093/fill/w_1272,h_1030,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271526735_483931813098208_4673103529748094764_n.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpfyobsg1" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_ae8e146c2b7c487bae42c77a88db9995~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_59,w_1350,h_1093/fill/w_636,h_515,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271526735_483931813098208_4673103529748094764_n.jpg" alt="271526735_483931813098208_4673103529748094764_n.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="636" height="515"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfysdhg" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfysdhg wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">A Gen 1 mask will feature one of these mouth defects (not multiple or all).</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpmzptwz" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpmzptwz wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The mouth markers are only used to identify that a mask is a Gen 1, not separate types. Qualities that may give masks more unique appearances can be from production (i.e. unique jawline shape from sewing the shroud) or era (i.e. vinyl thickness and paint stencils).</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpmzz11u" class="gpDCD5 comp-lpmzz11u"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpmzz11uinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpmzz11uinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn009o3" class="W4V2qg comp-lpn009o3 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="636px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_07628b7cbb8e49938521209bc3772c39~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_636,h_300,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Three_Molds.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_07628b7cbb8e49938521209bc3772c39~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1272,h_600,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Three_Molds.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpn009o3" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_07628b7cbb8e49938521209bc3772c39~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_636,h_300,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Three_Molds.jpg" alt="Three_Molds.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="636" height="300"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn0w9hh" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn0w9hh wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Example of three nearly identical Gen 1s with each mouth defect.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfz3m06" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfz3m06 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">There are other markings you can use to identify Gen 1s, like raised tick marks (opposed to indented) and a specific circular abrasion not found on other Fun World Div stamped mask types.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfz4053" class="comp-lpfz4053 wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfz4053inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfz4053inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfz408v" class="W4V2qg comp-lpfz408v wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="443px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_a89d86b555214ceba5e9c7d9cbb5f05e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_443,h_285,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/TICKS.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_a89d86b555214ceba5e9c7d9cbb5f05e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_787,h_506,al_c,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/TICKS.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpfz408v" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_a89d86b555214ceba5e9c7d9cbb5f05e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_443,h_285,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/TICKS.jpg" alt="TICKS.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="443" height="285"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfz4098" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfz4098 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Raised &quot;tick marks&quot; on temples and forehead of Gen 1.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfz4061" class="comp-lpfz4061 wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfz4061inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpfz4061inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfz40ba" class="W4V2qg comp-lpfz40ba wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="443px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_8f0ab20a838e4d7ebd88abe1b911a9b9~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_443,h_285,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/ABRASIONS.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_8f0ab20a838e4d7ebd88abe1b911a9b9~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_716,h_461,al_c,lg_1,q_80,enc_avif,quality_auto/ABRASIONS.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpfz40ba" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_8f0ab20a838e4d7ebd88abe1b911a9b9~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_443,h_285,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/ABRASIONS.jpg" alt="ABRASIONS.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="443" height="285"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfz40bd" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfz40bd wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Circular abrasion pattern on the left side of the mouth on each mold.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfy8b21" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfy8b21 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Gen 1s went through production differences over the years such as vinyl thickness, paint stencils, and shroud material. For this reason &quot;Gen 1&quot; does not refer to an era (as &quot;generation 1&quot; may sound) but a name for this particular batch of primary molds. The styles we&#39;ve distinguished are <span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Early 90s, Mid-90s, 97, </span>and<span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"> Poly Shroud</span>. </span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn0ynur" class="gpDCD5 comp-lpn0ynur"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpn0ynurinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpn0ynurinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn0zale" class="W4V2qg comp-lpn0zale wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="207px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_9e59140ef16748d9985da6ffe5f3ee7f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_207,h_276,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1_GEN1_EARLY90S.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_9e59140ef16748d9985da6ffe5f3ee7f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_414,h_552,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1_GEN1_EARLY90S.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpn0zale" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_9e59140ef16748d9985da6ffe5f3ee7f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_207,h_276,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1_GEN1_EARLY90S.jpg" alt="1_GEN1_EARLY90S.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="207" height="276"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydhqauv" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydhqauv wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">EARLY 90S&nbsp;</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydhrsgo" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydhrsgo wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Early 90s Gen 1s have thick firm vinyl with large nose and eye paint and cotton shrouds.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-m3fzvfu4" class="W4V2qg comp-m3fzvfu4 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="211px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_1d8b63c75fec47598cb08fac01ba6c4d~mv2.jpeg/v1/crop/x_0,y_134,w_1366,h_1780/fill/w_211,h_276,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screm_Jan.jpeg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_1d8b63c75fec47598cb08fac01ba6c4d~mv2.jpeg/v1/crop/x_0,y_134,w_1366,h_1780/fill/w_422,h_552,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screm_Jan.jpeg 2x" id="img_comp-m3fzvfu4" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_1d8b63c75fec47598cb08fac01ba6c4d~mv2.jpeg/v1/crop/x_0,y_134,w_1366,h_1780/fill/w_211,h_276,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screm_Jan.jpeg" alt="Screm_Jan.jpeg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="211" height="276"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydhr5d4" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydhr5d4 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">MID-90S</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydhsb09" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydhsb09 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">In the Mid-90s, production quality changed to have notably tighter stencils with smaller nose, eye, and mouth paint and softer flexible vinyl. Some masks from this era are particularly translucent floppy vinyl that display warped foreheads and shadowy eyes from the mesh showing through. That quality is nicknamed &quot;Scream Style&quot;, for their similar quality seen in Scream (1996).</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn0zaln2" class="W4V2qg comp-lpn0zaln2 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="211px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_fe6fc193620146e78e633cfe093dbcf8~mv2.jpeg/v1/crop/x_100,y_238,w_1266,h_1654/fill/w_211,h_276,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/97_Jan.jpeg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_fe6fc193620146e78e633cfe093dbcf8~mv2.jpeg/v1/crop/x_100,y_238,w_1266,h_1654/fill/w_422,h_552,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/97_Jan.jpeg 2x" id="img_comp-lpn0zaln2" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_fe6fc193620146e78e633cfe093dbcf8~mv2.jpeg/v1/crop/x_100,y_238,w_1266,h_1654/fill/w_211,h_276,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/97_Jan.jpeg" alt="97_Jan.jpeg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="211" height="276"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfx1u5y" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfx1u5y wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">97</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfx1u6z" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfx1u6z wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">In 1997, &#39;Weeping&#39; ghost masks had distinguishable heart-shaped nose stencils and exceptionally thin eyeliner.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn0zalp2" class="W4V2qg comp-lpn0zalp2 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="211px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_0199870c5a154202bbcbe7e4d394ba22~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_37,y_179,w_1283,h_1671/fill/w_211,h_276,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Poly_Jan.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_0199870c5a154202bbcbe7e4d394ba22~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_37,y_179,w_1283,h_1671/fill/w_422,h_552,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Poly_Jan.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpn0zalp2" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_0199870c5a154202bbcbe7e4d394ba22~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_37,y_179,w_1283,h_1671/fill/w_211,h_276,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Poly_Jan.jpg" alt="Poly_Jan.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="211" height="276"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfx8ypb" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfx8ypb wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">POLY</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydhsmmi" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydhsmmi wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Gen 1 molds saw their final use with polyester shrouds, <span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.itsfuntyme.com/post/vanilla-or-phthalates" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">vanilla scent</a></span>, and purple &#39;bat &amp; moon&#39; themed&nbsp;<span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Fearsome Faces</span>&nbsp;header cards. We believe the transition to polyester occurred in late 1997, tho we do not know what year Gen 1 polys ceased production.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph6n3hq" class="W4V2qg comp-lph6n3hq wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="194px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_194,h_71,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%20AM.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_388,h_142,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%20AM.png 2x" id="img_comp-lph6n3hq" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_194,h_71,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%20AM.png" alt="Screen Shot 2022-01-17 at 10.36.35 AM.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="194" height="71"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph6n3il" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lph6n3il wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Cotton shroud #9206 masks were packaged with a pink &#39;party orb&#39; style header tag labeled&nbsp;<span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Fantastic Faces</span>. They were offered from 1992 - 1997.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph6nq8r" class="W4V2qg comp-lph6nq8r wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="194px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_77471fccc11d4ca38589df37ef171649~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_0,w_882,h_323/fill/w_194,h_71,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271856977_529843324761811_5777747197402078027_n.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_77471fccc11d4ca38589df37ef171649~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_0,w_882,h_323/fill/w_388,h_142,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271856977_529843324761811_5777747197402078027_n.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lph6nq8r" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_77471fccc11d4ca38589df37ef171649~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_0,w_882,h_323/fill/w_194,h_71,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271856977_529843324761811_5777747197402078027_n.jpg" alt="271856977_529843324761811_5777747197402078027_n.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="194" height="71"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph6p019" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lph6p019 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Polyester shroud #9206 masks were packaged with a purple &#39;bat &amp; moon&#39; style header tag labeled&nbsp;<span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Fearsome Faces</span>.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydi8m77" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydi8m77 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,futura-lt-w05-book,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">*Gen 1 masks have been found as #9206 Glow-in-Dark Ghost Mask with Shroud (white, cotton, poly), #9207 Fluorescent Ghost Mask with Shroud (cotton), #9223 All-in-One Ghost Mask &amp; Gown, #9219 Instant Disguise, #8919 Droop Collar Mask, and #9974 Scream Stalker costume masks with bib.</span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kykk6sbp" class="comp-kykk6sbp nJiBti wixui-horizontal-line"></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydijanu" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydijanu wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:37px; text-align:center;"><span style="color:#CA3A00;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:caudex,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:37px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">SPLOTCH</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-li4q7lee" class="gpDCD5 comp-li4q7lee"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-li4q7leeinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-li4q7leeinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-li4q81ae" class="W4V2qg comp-li4q81ae wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="389px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_83e4691ab30f484283596e9ea74acbe6~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_389,h_514,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271659946_1530341177359563_2831646939443221853_n.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_83e4691ab30f484283596e9ea74acbe6~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_778,h_1028,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271659946_1530341177359563_2831646939443221853_n.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-li4q81ae" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_83e4691ab30f484283596e9ea74acbe6~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_389,h_514,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271659946_1530341177359563_2831646939443221853_n.jpg" alt="271659946_1530341177359563_2831646939443221853_n.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="389" height="514"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpfzywc5" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpfzywc5 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&quot;Splotch&quot; masks are a <span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">secondary factory variant</span> </span>named for their splat-like abrasions across the mouth and face. While they somewhat resemble Gen 1s more than other factory variants (like HNs or Gen 2s) a trained eye can recognize them for their unique appearance. Here are some qualities that differentiate them:</span></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
&nbsp;</p>

<ul class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif; letter-spacing:normal; font-size:17px;">
<li style="line-height:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Matte black paint</span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li style="line-height:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Flatter broad faces</span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li style="line-height:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Bloated cheeks</span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li style="line-height:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Indented tick marks</span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li style="line-height:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Closer carved perimeter line (thus, closer sewn and narrower looking jaws)</span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li style="line-height:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Additional and missing markings from Gen 1</span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li style="line-height:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Not found on all product variants</span></span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">We have identified a Splotch mask used in a small capacity </span></span></span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.itsfuntyme.com/post/was-splotch-used-in-scream" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">in Scream (1996)</a></span><a href="https://www.itsfuntyme.com/post/was-splotch-used-in-scream" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">, though Gen 1s are the primary film mask type.</a></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpt3wztc" class="W4V2qg comp-lpt3wztc wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="176px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_281011787f6c4dc2a6ceff74f636ebd9~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_176,h_437,al_c,lg_1,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/3-SPLOTCH-MARKING.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_281011787f6c4dc2a6ceff74f636ebd9~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_241,h_598,al_c,lg_1,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/3-SPLOTCH-MARKING.png 2x" id="img_comp-lpt3wztc" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_281011787f6c4dc2a6ceff74f636ebd9~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_176,h_437,al_c,lg_1,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/3-SPLOTCH-MARKING.png" alt="3-SPLOTCH-MARKING.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="176" height="437"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpt3xuhb" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpt3xuhb wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The &quot;Splotch&quot; mouth defect.</span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyezg07v" class="W4V2qg comp-kyezg07v wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="327px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_e2e93cff98094b08ad986ffd7f72db34~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_327,h_351,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotchtransparent.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_e2e93cff98094b08ad986ffd7f72db34~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_654,h_702,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotchtransparent.png 2x" id="img_comp-kyezg07v" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_e2e93cff98094b08ad986ffd7f72db34~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_327,h_351,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotchtransparent.png" alt="Splotchtransparent.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="327" height="351"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyezgzwh" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kyezgzwh wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Additional &quot;splotch&quot; abrasions on the mask&#39;s face, cheeks, and temples indicate it was likely a effect of the molding process.</span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyezgu1z" class="comp-kyezgu1z wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-kyezgu1zinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-kyezgu1zinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-kyez6357" class="W4V2qg comp-kyez6357 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="383px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_57a6aaaeaa024fb983c1af08ce617b94~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_383,h_168,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotch%20Tick%20Marks%201.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_57a6aaaeaa024fb983c1af08ce617b94~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_766,h_336,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotch%20Tick%20Marks%201.png 2x" id="img_comp-kyez6357" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_57a6aaaeaa024fb983c1af08ce617b94~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_383,h_168,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotch%20Tick%20Marks%201.png" alt="Splotch Tick Marks 1.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="383" height="168"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyez7rs3" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kyez7rs3 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Indented tick marks on Splotch (instead of raised Gen 1 marks).</span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kykdfsed" class="W4V2qg comp-kykdfsed wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="392px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_55d26cb79cc44123910fe8546e6c25cd~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_392,h_279,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotch%20JPG.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_55d26cb79cc44123910fe8546e6c25cd~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_784,h_558,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotch%20JPG.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-kykdfsed" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_55d26cb79cc44123910fe8546e6c25cd~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_392,h_279,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotch%20JPG.jpg" alt="Splotch JPG.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="392" height="279"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpg186dq" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpg186dq wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Examples of Splotch masks varying in quality and shape.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpna7dv1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpna7dv1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Splotch masks experienced a similar (but different) Early 90s, Mid-90s, and 97 trajectory, and have not been found with a polyester shroud, leading us to believe they ceased production in 1997.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn17z6i" class="gpDCD5 comp-lpn17z6i"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpn17z6iinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpn17z6iinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnctgjc" class="W4V2qg comp-lpnctgjc wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="280px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_eeeb03437c4a438180b6b3660247aa32~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_131,y_186,w_1273,h_1669/fill/w_280,h_368,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/429102241_7394145377313087_6033938045922418888_n.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_eeeb03437c4a438180b6b3660247aa32~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_131,y_186,w_1273,h_1669/fill/w_560,h_736,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/429102241_7394145377313087_6033938045922418888_n.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpnctgjc" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_eeeb03437c4a438180b6b3660247aa32~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_131,y_186,w_1273,h_1669/fill/w_280,h_368,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/429102241_7394145377313087_6033938045922418888_n.jpg" alt="429102241_7394145377313087_6033938045922418888_n.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="280" height="368"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn18v8w1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn18v8w1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">EARLY 90S</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn18v9e1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn18v9e1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Early 90s Splotch masks have large nose and eye paint and cotton shrouds. Unlike Gen 1s, they are sometimes very thin and floppy.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpncnuu4" class="W4V2qg comp-lpncnuu4 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="280px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_83e4691ab30f484283596e9ea74acbe6~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_48,y_77,w_1443,h_1896/fill/w_280,h_368,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271659946_1530341177359563_2831646939443221853_n.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_83e4691ab30f484283596e9ea74acbe6~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_48,y_77,w_1443,h_1896/fill/w_560,h_736,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271659946_1530341177359563_2831646939443221853_n.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpncnuu4" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_83e4691ab30f484283596e9ea74acbe6~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_48,y_77,w_1443,h_1896/fill/w_280,h_368,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271659946_1530341177359563_2831646939443221853_n.jpg" alt="271659946_1530341177359563_2831646939443221853_n.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="280" height="368"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn18v911" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn18v911 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">MID 90S</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn18v9g1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn18v9g1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">In the Mid-90s, production quality changed to have notably tighter stencils with smaller nose, eye, and mouth paint. Some Mid-90s Splotch masks actually have thicker vinyl than their Early 90s counterparts. While mid-90s Splotches seem particularly uncommon, some masks have surfaced with the &quot;Scream Style&quot; features described in the previous chapter.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn18v981" class="W4V2qg comp-lpn18v981 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="280px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_cfc8dbe5702c49aaaf370bc87e730213~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_80,y_234,w_1182,h_1542/fill/w_280,h_368,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotch_97.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_cfc8dbe5702c49aaaf370bc87e730213~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_80,y_234,w_1182,h_1542/fill/w_560,h_736,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotch_97.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpn18v981" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_cfc8dbe5702c49aaaf370bc87e730213~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_80,y_234,w_1182,h_1542/fill/w_280,h_368,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Splotch_97.jpg" alt="Splotch_97.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="280" height="368"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn18v9a1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn18v9a1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">97</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn18v9l1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn18v9l1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">In 1997, &#39;Weeping&#39; ghost masks had distinguishable heart-shaped nose stencils and exceptionally thin eyeliner. Splotch masks have not been found with polyester shrouds.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph6re6q" class="W4V2qg comp-lph6re6q wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="194px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_194,h_71,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%20AM.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_388,h_142,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%20AM.png 2x" id="img_comp-lph6re6q" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_194,h_71,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%20AM.png" alt="Screen Shot 2022-01-17 at 10.36.35 AM.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="194" height="71"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph6re81" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lph6re81 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Splotch masks have only been found with cotton shrouds and pink &#39;party orb&#39; style header tags labeled&nbsp;<span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Fantastic Faces</span>. They were offered from 1992 - 1997.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydislvw" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydislvw wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,futura-lt-w05-book,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">*Splotch masks have been found as #9206 Glow-in-Dark Ghost Mask with Shroud (white and black cotton), and #9207 Fluorescent Ghost Mask with Shroud (cotton).</span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kykk70ad" class="comp-kykk70ad nJiBti wixui-horizontal-line"></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyhkcu1q" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kyhkcu1q wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:37px; text-align:center;"><span style="color:#9AB373;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:caudex,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:37px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">HN</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-li4q8pjg" class="gpDCD5 comp-li4q8pjg"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-li4q8pjginlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-li4q8pjginlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-li4q8z1e" class="W4V2qg comp-li4q8z1e wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="389px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_e5aedfdbdf424008984f149e0cb7d7b2~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_389,h_514,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_e5aedfdbdf424008984f149e0cb7d7b2~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_778,h_1028,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN.png 2x" id="img_comp-li4q8z1e" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_e5aedfdbdf424008984f149e0cb7d7b2~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_389,h_514,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN.png" alt="HN.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="389" height="514"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph81766" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lph81766 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&quot;HN&quot; masks are a <span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">tertiary factory variant</span> with uniquely rectangular eye mesh and more skeletal nose paint. While they are not featured in any Scream film, they&#39;re reasonably collectible for their vintage quality. Though they derive from the original sculpt, they have a unique look from how the master may have been stuffed and mounted when molding. They are easily identified by a small raised </span><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif; font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">H&nbsp;</span><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">or carved&nbsp;</span><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif; font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">HN</span><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;letters under the chin. The letters </span><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">signify</span><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;the&nbsp;</span><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">particular factory, as do other lettered stamps (such as MK, T, N, and TD) on later masks. They have only been found as black and white cotton shroud masks. We can currently date them as early as 1995.</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyivssjv" class="comp-kyivssjv wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-kyivssjvinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-kyivssjvinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-kyivjvuv" class="W4V2qg comp-kyivjvuv wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="222px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_587a784b20294eb1aa61234482b1bbd6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_222,h_290,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN1.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_587a784b20294eb1aa61234482b1bbd6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_444,h_580,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN1.png 2x" id="img_comp-kyivjvuv" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_587a784b20294eb1aa61234482b1bbd6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_222,h_290,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN1.png" alt="HN1.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="222" height="290"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyivk0ep" class="W4V2qg comp-kyivk0ep wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="222px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_adfbc9d815334054b0bbf6418548e429~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_222,h_290,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN2.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_adfbc9d815334054b0bbf6418548e429~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_444,h_580,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN2.png 2x" id="img_comp-kyivk0ep" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_adfbc9d815334054b0bbf6418548e429~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_222,h_290,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN2.png" alt="HN2.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="222" height="290"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyhkcu2l" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kyhkcu2l wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Example of masks with &quot;HN&quot; letters.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kykbica3" class="W4V2qg comp-kykbica3 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="222px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_ec27111a869d4621bd6384a9b9cbf8ad~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_222,h_290,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN%20Eye%20Mesh.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_ec27111a869d4621bd6384a9b9cbf8ad~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_444,h_580,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN%20Eye%20Mesh.png 2x" id="img_comp-kykbica3" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_ec27111a869d4621bd6384a9b9cbf8ad~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_222,h_290,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN%20Eye%20Mesh.png" alt="HN Eye Mesh.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="222" height="290"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kykbica