arcode of a raised H mask.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyhkcu2n" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kyhkcu2n wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">All HN masks have the raised &quot;H&quot; near the neckline. However, only some masks have the carved &quot;HN&quot; letters and are usually found above the Fun World Div stamp near the tip of the chin. Here are examples of other HN factory ghost masks:</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kykbc88z" class="W4V2qg comp-kykbc88z wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="239px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_b7bad7c68f0f457b8f09d9afe0952eef~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_239,h_362,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN%20Silly%20Ghost.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_b7bad7c68f0f457b8f09d9afe0952eef~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_478,h_724,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN%20Silly%20Ghost.png 2x" id="img_comp-kykbc88z" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_b7bad7c68f0f457b8f09d9afe0952eef~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_239,h_362,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN%20Silly%20Ghost.png" alt="HN Silly Ghost.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="239" height="362"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kykbsjer" class="W4V2qg comp-kykbsjer wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="253px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_432f7691be544e3abde028d7de3c780d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_89,y_0,w_1406,h_2010/fill/w_253,h_362,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/HN%20Happy