zy" sizes="194px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_194,h_71,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%20AM.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_388,h_142,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%20AM.png 2x" id="img_comp-lph6ssr8" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_194,h_71,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%20AM.png" alt="Screen Shot 2022-01-17 at 10.36.35 AM.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="194" height="71"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph6sss6" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lph6sss6 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">HN masks have only been found as #9206 cotton shroud masks with pink &#39;party orb&#39; style header tags labeled&nbsp;<span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Fantastic Faces</span>.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyhkcu2t1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kyhkcu2t1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,futura-lt-w05-book,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">*HN masks have been found as #9206 Glow-in-Dark Ghost Mask with Shroud (white and black cotton).</span></span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kykk7d34" class="comp-kykk7d34 nJiBti wixui-horizontal-line"></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyditnu7" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kyditnu7 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:37px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_41 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:caudex,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:37px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">GEN 2</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lph4s3f7" class="gpDCD5 comp-lph4s3f7"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lph4s3f7inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lph4s3f7inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lph4s3ie" class="W4V2qg comp-lph4s3ie wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="389px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_b9157b3fd3da49e7828b7594347bd104~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_389,h_514,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gen%202.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_b9157b3fd3da49e7828b7594347bd104~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_778,h_1028,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gen%202.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lph4s3ie" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_b9157b3fd3da49e7828b7594347bd104~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_389,h_514,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gen%202.jpg" alt="Gen 2.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="389" height="514"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kydiu13k" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-kydiu13k wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&quot;Gen 2&quot; masks are another popular mask type and were used in <span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Scream 2 (1997)</span>. Gen 2 is not a &quot;second generation&quot; of molds, but a nickname given by fans during a time early masks were incorrectly seen as a binary. They have heart shaped nose paint and appear somewhat long faced with pushed out nose bridges, squared jaws, and larger eyes. Like HNs, the bloating is likely a result of how the master was mounted during the molding process. As former Fun World designer Brigitte Sleiertin-Linden tells us &quot;<span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">when the company increased production to meet demand after the mask got popular, they had multiple factories making the same item</span>&quot;. The earliest we may be able to date Gen 2s is currently 1996. Gen 2s for all of the ghost characters became the primary production for the #9206 and #9207 assortments in 1997 on.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnbepj11" class="gpDCD5 comp-lpnbepj11"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpnbepj11inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpnbepj11inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnbepj41" class="comp-lpnbepj41 wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpnbepj41inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpnbepj41inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnbepj61" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpnbepj61 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">UPPER DIMPLE</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnbepj81" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpnbepj81 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">CHEEK POCKS</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnbepjc" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpnbepjc wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">TEXTURED MOUTH</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnbepje" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpnbepje wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">DOT</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnbepjg" class="W4V2qg comp-lpnbepjg wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="723px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_7d7b8141c08741ca9c5735363b8b6b71~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_1,y_40,w_854,h_597/fill/w_723,h_505,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/GEN%202%20MOLD%20CHART.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_7d7b8141c08741ca9c5735363b8b6b71~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_1,y_40,w_854,h_597/fill/w_854,h_597,al_c,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/GEN%202%20MOLD%20CHART.png 2x" id="img_comp-lpnbepjg" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_7d7b8141c08741ca9c5735363b8b6b71~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_1,y_40,w_854,h_597/fill/w_723,h_505,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/GEN%202%20MOLD%20CHART.png" alt="GEN 2 MOLD CHART.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="723" height="505"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnbpvda" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpnbpvda wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_38 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">A Gen 2 mask may feature one of these defects (not multiple or all).</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpnbg8mn" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpnbg8mn wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Though we&#39;ve recognized a few markings to identify Gen 2 masks, there seem to be many more additional production molds, which makes sense considering the rising popularity the Scream brought the design.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn1u2hl" class="gpDCD5 comp-lpn1u2hl"><div class="jv9xi4 wixui-box" data-testid="container-bg"></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpn1u2hlinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lpn1u2hlinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn21csf" class="W4V2qg comp-lpn21csf wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="277px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_18ba3bcbd5bc4048bc5bf2303127abee~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_96,y_218,w_1194,h_1561/fill/w_277,h_362,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Early_Gen_2.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_18ba3bcbd5bc4048bc5bf2303127abee~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_96,y_218,w_1194,h_1561/fill/w_554,h_724,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Early_Gen_2.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpn21csf" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_18ba3bcbd5bc4048bc5bf2303127abee~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_96,y_218,w_1194,h_1561/fill/w_277,h_362,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Early_Gen_2.jpg" alt="Early_Gen_2.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="277" height="362"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn1u2jp1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn1u2jp1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">MID-90S</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn1u2jv" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn1u2jv wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The earliest we can currently date Gen 2s may be 1996. Mid-90s are less common and feature larger paint stencils than their 97 counterparts.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn21cti" class="W4V2qg comp-lpn21cti wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="277px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_b9157b3fd3da49e7828b7594347bd104~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_132,w_1365,h_1784/fill/w_277,h_362,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gen%202.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_b9157b3fd3da49e7828b7594347bd104~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_132,w_1365,h_1784/fill/w_554,h_724,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gen%202.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpn21cti" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_b9157b3fd3da49e7828b7594347bd104~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_132,w_1365,h_1784/fill/w_277,h_362,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gen%202.jpg" alt="Gen 2.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="277" height="362"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn1u2jx2" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn1u2jx2 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">97</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn1u2jz2" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn1u2jz2 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">In 1997, Gen 2 masks featured distinctly thin eyeliner and feature recognizable heart-shaped nose. Masks nicknamed &quot;Scream 2-style&quot; are 97 masks with characteristics similar to those from <span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Scream 2 </span>(1997), such as wider cut jaws that expose the perimeter line.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn21cuq" class="W4V2qg comp-lpn21cuq wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="277px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_1fe73e76e42f42d1b48a67a33ecdd444~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_89,y_168,w_2859,h_3743/fill/w_277,h_362,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271399028_303663845052709_7821925297475397196_n.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_1fe73e76e42f42d1b48a67a33ecdd444~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_89,y_168,w_2859,h_3743/fill/w_554,h_724,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271399028_303663845052709_7821925297475397196_n.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-lpn21cuq" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_1fe73e76e42f42d1b48a67a33ecdd444~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_89,y_168,w_2859,h_3743/fill/w_277,h_362,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/271399028_303663845052709_7821925297475397196_n.jpg" alt="271399028_303663845052709_7821925297475397196_n.jpg" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="277" height="362"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn1u2k61" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn1u2k61 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:17px;"><span style="font-size:17px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_45 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-shadow:#ffffff -1px -1px 0px, #ffffff -1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px 1px 0px, #ffffff 1px -1px 0px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">POLY</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lpn1u2k82" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-lpn1u2k82 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Gen 2 molds saw their final use with polyester shrouds and&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.itsfuntyme.com/post/vanilla-or-phthalates" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="wixui-rich-text__text">vanilla scent</a></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:12px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">We believe the transition to polyester occurred in late 1997.</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-kyiuw4gi" class="W4V2qg comp-kyiuw4gi wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="194px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c5c9bd_d04bae2567844da5b0960032ffaeb23d~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_3,w_856,h_313/fill/w_194,h_71,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Screen%20Shot%202022-01-17%20at%2010_36_35%